4010       data FerriteCores;
4011       do Temp = 1 to 4;
4012       do rep = 1 to 5;
4013       drop rep;
4014       input MagneticForce @@;
4015       output;
4016       end;
4017       end;
4018       datalines;

NOTE: SAS went to a new line when INPUT statement reached past the end of a line.
NOTE: The data set WORK.FERRITECORES has 20 observations and 2 variables.

4023       ;
4024       proc mixed data=FerriteCores;
4025       class Temp;
4026       model MagneticForce = Temp;
4027       lsmestimate Temp
4028       'avg(1:1)<avg(2:4)' -3 1 1 1 divisor=3,
4029       'avg(1:2)<avg(3:4)' -1 -1 1 1 divisor=2,
4030       'avg(1:3)<avg(4:4)' -1 -1 -1 3 divisor=3
4031       / adjust=simulate(seed=1) cl upper;
4032       ods select LSMestimates;
4033       run;

NOTE: Random number seed for this analysis set to 1.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE MIXED printed page 308.

